<title>UK: Zimbabwe buys 28,000 tonnes raw sugar -traders.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe buys 28,000 tonnes raw sugar -traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe bought 28,000 tonnes of raw sugar for January/February arrival from a London-based trade house, traders said on Monday. Details of the price achieved have yet to emerge and local refiner ZSR said earlier it would only release the result of its buying tender to the successful bidder.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
